WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.100
-Guys, the Kentucky Derby
is tomorrow.

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.634
Now, usually there's a horse

00:00:03.634 --> 00:00:05.667
that's a clear favorite,
but not this year.

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:07.834
It's nearly impossible
to predict the winner.

00:00:07.834 --> 00:00:09.701
Well, you guys are in luck,
because, when it comes

00:00:09.701 --> 00:00:11.934
to predicting things,
we have a secret weapon,

00:00:11.934 --> 00:00:13.234
and it's puppies.

00:00:13.234 --> 00:00:13.934
That's right.

00:00:13.934 --> 00:00:14.634
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:14.634 --> 00:00:15.767
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:00:15.767 --> 00:00:17.100
it's time for

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:20.567
"The Puppy Predictors:
2022 Kentucky Derby Edition."

00:00:20.567 --> 00:00:23.200
♪♪

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:26.067
-♪ Puppy Predictors ♪

00:00:26.067 --> 00:00:28.200
[ Cheering and applause ]
-Welcome to the

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:31.467
"Puppy Predictors:
2022 Kentucky Derby Edition."

00:00:31.467 --> 00:00:34.100
Now, here's how it works.
We have eight adorable puppies,

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:37.000
each representing one of the
top eight horses competing

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.400
in Saturday's big race,

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.634
and one giant trough of kibble.

00:00:40.634 --> 00:00:42.434
[ Laughter and oohs ]

00:00:42.434 --> 00:00:44.501
Whichever puppy
crosses the finish line

00:00:44.501 --> 00:00:46.000
and reaches the trough first,

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.334
they will be crowned
the Kentucky Derby winner.

00:00:48.334 --> 00:00:50.567
Now, let's meet the puppies.

00:00:50.567 --> 00:00:53.033
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:53.033 --> 00:00:55.367
♪♪

00:00:55.367 --> 00:00:56.501
Now.

00:01:02.968 --> 00:01:06.133
Now, lined up at the gate --
starting gate,

00:01:06.133 --> 00:01:09.167
we have the favorite, Zandon.

00:01:09.167 --> 00:01:12.367
[ Laughter and cheering ]
Then we have Epicenter.

00:01:12.367 --> 00:01:14.033
Then we have Messier.

00:01:14.033 --> 00:01:15.133
-[ Grumble ]

00:01:15.133 --> 00:01:16.467
Mo Donegal.
-[ Yipping ]

00:01:16.467 --> 00:01:20.567
[ Laughter ]
-We have White Abarrio.

00:01:20.567 --> 00:01:21.701
Taiba.

00:01:21.701 --> 00:01:23.067
Cyberknife.

00:01:23.067 --> 00:01:26.367
[ Laughter ]
And, finally,
we have the long shot --

00:01:26.367 --> 00:01:27.701
Simplification.

00:01:27.701 --> 00:01:29.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:29.434 --> 00:01:31.300
Simplification,
that's who I'm going with.

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:32.868
Alright, guys, before I relea--

00:01:32.868 --> 00:01:34.934
What?
Cyberknife, focus.

00:01:34.934 --> 00:01:36.734
[ Laughter ]
No, over here. Cyberknife.

00:01:36.734 --> 00:01:38.000
Focus up.
Alright,

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:39.267
[ Awws ]
before I release you...

00:01:39.267 --> 00:01:40.901
-[ Whimpering ]
-...no butt sniffing.

00:01:40.901 --> 00:01:42.667
[ Laughter ]
No peeing.

00:01:42.667 --> 00:01:44.934
No -- Alright, I want this
to be a clean race.

00:01:44.934 --> 00:01:46.167
Hello.
Who are you again?

00:01:46.167 --> 00:01:47.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:48.434
Taiba.
No, no, no, get down.

00:01:48.434 --> 00:01:49.400
No, Cyberknife!
Here.

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:50.934
No, you're not --
Simplification.

00:01:50.934 --> 00:01:53.000
[ Laughter ]
Cyberknife! Cyberknife.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:54.567
No, Cyberknife, stop talking.

00:01:54.567 --> 00:01:56.033
[ Laughter ]
Cyberknife, over here.

00:01:56.033 --> 00:01:57.300
Guys, stop mingling.

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:58.767
I just warned you.
Okay.

00:01:58.767 --> 00:01:59.567
Here we go.

00:01:59.567 --> 00:02:00.934
Alright, are you guys ready?

00:02:00.934 --> 00:02:02.734
Roots, whenever you're ready,
Roots.

00:02:02.734 --> 00:02:07.267
[ Playing "Call to the Post" ]

00:02:07.267 --> 00:02:10.400
[ Cheering and applause ]
Okay, release the puppies!

00:02:12.033 --> 00:02:14.434
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:15.968
[ Bell dings ]
Whoa!

00:02:15.968 --> 00:02:17.234
Number 6!

00:02:17.234 --> 00:02:19.234
I think it was Number 6, right?

00:02:19.234 --> 00:02:21.267
Look at this right here.

00:02:21.267 --> 00:02:23.100
Number s--

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:26.000
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.267
Number 6 is the winner!
Taiba!

00:02:28.267 --> 00:02:31.167
[ Cheering and applause ]
[ Sting plays ]

00:02:31.167 --> 00:02:33.834
[ Ohs and awws ]

00:02:33.834 --> 00:02:34.567
Taiba.

00:02:34.567 --> 00:02:35.634
[ Giggles ]

00:02:35.634 --> 00:02:37.000
[ Awws ]
Oh.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.267
You gave me a smacker there.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:43.434
[ Awws ]
You gave me a real good
kiss there.

00:02:43.434 --> 00:02:47.734
Taiba will be crowned the
2022 Kentucky Derby Champion.

00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:49.868
[ Cheering and applause ]
Enjoy the race, everyone.

00:02:49.868 --> 00:02:52.267
Stick around. We'll be
right back with Sophie Turner.

00:02:52.267 --> 00:02:54.067
[ Cheering and applause ]
Hi, bud.

00:02:54.067 --> 00:02:55.767
You did good.
Want to go eat more?

00:02:55.767 --> 00:02:56.434
Go, go, go.

00:02:56.434 --> 00:02:58.467
Go down.
Go, eat.

